Package: NHSssnapR
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Sentinel Stroke National Audit Programme (SSNAP) Local Data Processing and Reporting
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      "Adam", "Crane",
      email = "adam.crane@nhs.net",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides a standardised framework for importing, validating, transforming,   
    and analysing Sentinel Stroke National Audit Programme (SSNAP) data within NHS organisations. 
    The package supports the calculation of SSNAP performance indicators, 
    generation of reproducible visualisations and reports, and the production of consistent local, 
    regional, and organisational performance outputs. Designed to improve efficiency, 
    reproducibility, and standardisation of stroke audit reporting workflows 
    across NHS trusts and integrated stroke delivery networks (ISDNs).
